WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.623
Zero C#

00:00:01.659 --> 00:00:02.755
a bflat fork

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:04.992
Zero C# compiles

00:00:04.803 --> 00:00:05.864
C# straight to

00:00:05.676 --> 00:00:06.985
small native programs

00:00:06.796 --> 00:00:08.447
with no.NET runtime

00:00:08.329 --> 00:00:09.237
or GC

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:10.735
using arena memory

00:00:10.853 --> 00:00:11.595
and runs the

00:00:11.407 --> 00:00:12.503
same source on

00:00:12.315 --> 00:00:14.508
Linux macOS Windows

00:00:14.579 --> 00:00:15.805
WebAssembly and

00:00:15.829 --> 00:00:16.760
even DOS on

00:00:16.572 --> 00:00:18.341
a 386

00:00:18.862 --> 00:00:19.946
You keep C#

00:00:19.758 --> 00:00:20.512
syntax

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.739
type checking real

00:00:21.551 --> 00:00:23.154
generics interfaces

00:00:23.213 --> 00:00:25.159
records and C# 15

00:00:24.971 --> 00:00:25.949
features such as

00:00:25.761 --> 00:00:26.479
unions

00:00:26.562 --> 00:00:27.588
but anything a

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.484
runtime would do

00:00:28.296 --> 00:00:29.251
while the program

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:30.088
runs is gone

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:31.757
Memory comes from

00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:32.465
arenas that are

00:00:32.277 --> 00:00:33.078
freed all at

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:33.915
once and a

00:00:33.727 --> 00:00:35.295
small library supplies

00:00:35.107 --> 00:00:36.557
strings collections

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.382
and I/O on

00:00:37.194 --> 00:00:38.114
those terms

00:00:38.646 --> 00:00:39.660
Full story on

00:00:39.471 --> 00:00:40.367
the dashboard
